# Whitelist: the harness is versioned, everything a run produces is not.
#
# Workers write their own throwaway probe scripts here (slice1/, scripts3/, s2_*.py, ...)
# alongside findings, screenshots and session state. Roughly a hundred files per run, all
# specific to one run against one dataset. Tracking them would bury the four files that
# actually define the harness, so this ignores everything and re-includes only those.
*

!.gitignore
!PLAN.md
!run.ps1
!prompts/
!prompts/*.md
